<div class="report-export__header">
  <h1>TAMU-CAT Example Reports</h1>
  <p>Static synthetic examples showing the structure of the current application report modules.</p>
</div>

<h2>Example 1: MHA Program Analytics</h2>
<p>This synthetic example shows program-level achievement, cohort context, competency distributions, course-level achievement, and data-quality indicators. It contains no live student data.</p>

<section class="report-export">
  <header class="report-export__header">
    <h1 class="c-page-title">MHA Program Analytics</h1>
    <p>Example Reports | Generated for demonstration purposes</p>
    <p class="report-export__note">All values are synthetic. No live student data is included.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="report-export__section">
    <h2 class="c-section-title">Active Filters</h2>
    <div class="c-table-wrapper">
      <table class="c-table report-export__table">
        <tbody>
          <tr><th>Track</th><td>All tracks</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Year</th><td>Class of 2027</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Semester</th><td>All semesters</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Course Competency Rule</th><td>Average</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="report-export__section">
    <h2 class="c-section-title">Key Metrics</h2>
    <div class="c-table-wrapper">
      <table class="c-table report-export__table">
        <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Value</th><th>Description</th><th>Sample Size</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Benchmark Attainment</td><td>79%</td><td>Assessed students meeting the configured program target.</td><td>39</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Not Assessed</td><td>3 students</td><td>Level 0 results shown separately and excluded from attainment denominators.</td><td>39</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Survey Completion</td><td>100%</td><td>Percent of assigned surveys submitted.</td><td>42</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="report-export__section">
    <h2 class="c-section-title">Track Achievement</h2>
    <p class="report-export__note">Achievement percentages use assessed students only. Not-assessed counts use the full cohort.</p>
    <div class="chart-block">
      <h3 class="c-h3">% All Competencies Achieved by Track</h3>
      <div class="chart-legend">
        <span class="chart-legend__item"><span class="chart-legend__swatch" style="background-color: #16a34a"></span>Achieved</span>
        <span class="chart-legend__item"><span class="chart-legend__swatch" style="background-color: #dc2626"></span>Not Met</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-horizontal">
        <div class="chart-horizontal__row">
          <div class="chart-horizontal__label">Residential, Class of 2027</div>
          <div class="chart-horizontal__bar"><div style="float: left; height: 100%; width: 72.7%; background-color: #16a34a;"></div><div style="float: left; height: 100%; width: 27.3%; background-color: #dc2626;"></div></div>
          <div class="chart-horizontal__value">72.7%</div>
        </div>
        <div class="chart-horizontal__row">
          <div class="chart-horizontal__label">Executive, Class of 2027</div>
          <div class="chart-horizontal__bar"><div style="float: left; height: 100%; width: 52.9%; background-color: #16a34a;"></div><div style="float: left; height: 100%; width: 47.1%; background-color: #dc2626;"></div></div>
          <div class="chart-horizontal__value">52.9%</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="c-table-wrapper">
      <table class="c-table report-export__table">
        <thead><tr><th>Track</th><th>Class</th><th>Total Students</th><th>Assessed</th><th>Achieved</th><th>Not Met</th><th>Not Assessed</th><th>Achieved %</th><th>Not Met %</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Residential</td><td>Class of 2027</td><td>24</td><td>22</td><td>16</td><td>6</td><td>2</td><td>72.7%</td><td>27.3%</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Executive</td><td>Class of 2027</td><td>18</td><td>17</td><td>9</td><td>8</td><td>1</td><td>52.9%</td><td>47.1%</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="report-export__section">
    <h2 class="c-section-title">Program-Level Competency Achievement</h2>
    <p class="report-export__note">Proficiency scale: 0 / Not able to assess (advisor/report-only), 1 / Beginner, 2 / Emerging, 3 / Capable, 4 / Experienced, 5 / Mastery.</p>
    <p class="report-export__note">For this example, the configured program target is 4. Achieved means a rating greater than or equal to 4; not achieved means an assessed rating below 4. Level 0 is advisor/report-only, remains visible, and is excluded from achieved/not-achieved denominators.</p>
    <div class="c-table-wrapper">
      <table class="c-table report-export__table">
        <thead><tr><th>Track</th><th>Class</th><th>Competency</th><th>0 / Not Able to Assess</th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>5</th><th>Total Students</th><th>Assessed</th><th>Achieved %</th><th>Not Achieved %</th><th>Target Met</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Residential</td><td>Class of 2027</td><td>Financial Management</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>5</td><td>12</td><td>4</td><td>24</td><td>22</td><td>72.7%</td><td>27.3%</td><td>Met</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Executive</td><td>Class of 2027</td><td>Financial Management</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>2</td><td>18</td><td>17</td><td>52.9%</td><td>47.1%</td><td>Not Met</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="report-export__note">Not able to assess is reported separately from assessed attainment at both competency and cohort levels. A cohort with only not-assessed results has no achieved or not-achieved percentage.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="report-export__section">
    <h2 class="c-section-title">Course-Level Competency Achievement</h2>
    <p class="report-export__note">Course-derived results are distinct from student self-assessment and advisor feedback.</p>
    <div class="c-table-wrapper">
      <table class="c-table report-export__table">
        <thead><tr><th>Course</th><th>Track</th><th>Cohort</th><th>Achievement Level</th><th>Evidence Rows</th><th>Below Target</th><th>No Course Target</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>PHPM-601</td><td>Residential</td><td>2027</td><td>4</td><td>42</td><td>7</td><td>0</td></tr>
          <tr><td>HADM-610</td><td>Executive</td><td>2027</td><td>3</td><td>31</td><td>9</td><td>0</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="report-export__note"><strong>Notice:</strong> All values in this example packet are synthetic and are included only to demonstrate report structure.</p>
</section>
